 Medium Detail Information 
 
 
 
 
 Medium No. 
 
 1321 
 
 
 
 Medium 
 
 Medium for Strain Pf12B 
 
 
 
 Composition 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; NaCl 20 g &nbsp; MgCl 2 &middot;6H 2 O 3 g &nbsp; CaCl 2 &middot;2H 2 O 0.15 g &nbsp; Na 2 SO 4 4 g &nbsp; NH 4 Cl 0.25 g &nbsp; KH 2 PO 4 0.2 g &nbsp; KCl 0.5 g &nbsp; Sodium formate 0.68 g &nbsp; Yeast extract 0.5 g &nbsp; Resazurin 1 mg &nbsp; Trace element mixture* 1 ml &nbsp; Selenite-tungstate solution** 1 ml &nbsp; Bicarbonate solution (1.0 M)*** 30 ml &nbsp; Vitamin solution**** 1 ml &nbsp; Thiamine solution***** 1 ml &nbsp; Vitamin B 12 solution****** 1 ml &nbsp; Sulfide solution (1.0 M)******* 1.5 ml &nbsp; Distilled water 963.5 ml &nbsp; pH 7.0-7.3 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mix ingredients except for yeast extract, bicarbonate, vitamin, thiamine, cyanocobalamin and sulfide solutions. Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels under a stream of the N 2 /CO 2 (80/20) mixed gas, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave at 121&deg;C for 15 min. Aseptically and anaerobically add other ingredients using sterile syringes. Adjust pH to 7.0-7.3 using compact pH meter. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *Trace element mixture &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; HCl (25%; 7.7 M) 12.5 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; FeSO 4 &middot;7H 2 O 2100 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; H 3 BO 3 30 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MnCl 2 &middot;4H 2 O 100 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; CoCl 2 &middot;6H 2 O 190 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; NiCl 2 &middot;6H 2 O 24 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; CuCl 2 &middot;2H 2 O 2 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ZnSO 4 &middot;7H 2 O 144 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Na 2 MoO 4 &middot;2H 2 O 36 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Distilled water 987 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by autoclaving. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; **Selenite-tungstate solution &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; NaOH 0.4 g &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Na 2 SeO 3 &middot;5H 2 O 6 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Na 2 WO 4 &middot;2H 2 O 8 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Distilled water 1 L &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by autoclaving. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ***Bicarbonate solution (1.0 M) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; NaHCO 3 8.4 g &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Distilled water 100 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Saturated with CO 2 gas. Tightly sealed in bottles filled with CO 2 gas and then sterilized by autoclaving. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ****Vitamine solution &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; p -Aminobenzoic acid 4 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Biotin 1 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Nicotinic acid 10 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ca-pantothenate 5 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pyridoxine-HCl 15 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sodium phosphate buffer (10 mM; pH7.1) 100 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by filtration. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *****Thiamine solution &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Thiamine-HCl 10 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sodium phosphate buffer (25 mM; pH 3.4) 100 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by filtration. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ******Vitamin B 12 solution &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cyanocobalamin 5 mg &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Distilled water 100 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by filtration. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *******Sulfide solution (1.0 M) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Na 2 S&middot;9H 2 O 24 g &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Distilled water 100 ml &nbsp; &nbsp; Sterilized by filtration and stored under N 2 gas. 
 
 
 
